# Do not commit signing keys or credentials
connect-release.pfx
connect-release.keystore
credentials.json
# Play Store upload key credentials (android/keystore.properties + android/app/play-upload.keystore)
keystore.properties
# ⛔ ...and any RENAMED or backup copy of them. A suffix such as
# "play-upload.keystore.superseded-connectcomms" slips straight past both
# `*.keystore` and `keystore.properties` — two such files were sitting
# untracked and unignored on 2026-08-21, one `git add -A` away from
# publishing the Play upload key and its password.
*.keystore.*
*.jks.*
keystore.properties.*
# NOTE: google-services.json is intentionally tracked so EAS Build can embed
# it into the APK during the build. The API key in this file is a low-risk
# Android client key — the actual security is enforced by Firebase Security Rules.
/*.txt
